\documentclass[11pt, a4paper]{article}

\usepackage{graphicx}
\usepackage{booktabs}
\usepackage{amsmath}
\usepackage{url}

\title{\textbf{Q1\_R26: Metabolic State Clustering Analysis}}
\author{Analysis of Choudhury et al. 2022 (3CA:20773)}
\date{}

\begin{document}

\maketitle

\section{Introduction}

This analysis investigates whether transcriptional metabolic states can be used to cluster or separate groups in the single-cell RNA-seq dataset from the Choudhury et al. 2022 study. The study examines brain tissue from patients with meningioma using 10x Genomics technology.

\section{Methods}

\subsection{Data Processing}

